    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Myofibroblastoma shows a mostly circumscribed, unencapsulated mass composed of bland spindle to ovoid cells amidst a fibrocollagenous stroma. Mature adipocytes are present within the lesion. Immunohistochemistry shows positive reactivity of the spindle cells for CD34 and desmin.</p>",
